{
  "id": "1CH.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "I Lemkei 27",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie nyithindho mir Israel calku wel migi, wi udi pa wego man jego mi rubanga man mi dak, man jukal migi m’utimo ni ubimo, i lembe moko mi kur m’umondo m’uwok de dwi ku dwi ceke mi rundi, mi kur ceke kubang’e kubang’e en e rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wi kur ma kwong’ane mi dwi ma kwong’ane en e Yarcobeam ma wod Zabdiel: man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man en e mi nyithindho pa Perez, ma jadit mi jego ceke mir udul i dwi ma kwong’ane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wi kur mi dwi mir arionde en e Dodai ma Jaahohi, ku kur pare; man Mikloth ma jabim: man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jego mir adege mir udul mi dwi mir adege en e Benaya, ma wod Yehoida ma jalam, e jadit: man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni Benaya maeno, ma en e dhanu ma tek ma kind pier adek, man en e wi pier adekne: man mi kur pare en e Amizabad ma wode. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jego mir ang’wende mi dwi mir ang’wende en e Asahel m’umin Yoab, man Zebadia ma wode yo ng’eye: man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jego mir abije mi dwi mir abije en e Camhuth ma Jaizrahi: man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jego mir abusiende mi dwi mir abusiende en e Ira ma wod Ikec ma Jatekohi: man i kur pare rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jego mir abirone mi dwi mir abirone en e Helez ma Japeloni, mi nyithindho pa Efraim: man i kur pare rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jego mir aborane mi dwi mir aborane en e Sibekai ma Jahucathi, mi Juzerahi: man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jego mir abung’wende mi dwi mir abung’wende en e Abiezer ma Jaanathothi, mi Jubenyamini: man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jego mir apaje mi dwi mir apaje en e Maharai ma Janetofathi, mi Juzerahi: man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jego mir apar wi acende mi dwi apar wi acende en e Benaya ma Japirathoni, mi nyithindho pa Efraim: man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jego mir apar wi arionde mi dwi apar wi arionde en e Heldai ma Janetofathi, pa Othniel; man i kur pare dhanu rubanga pier ario wi ang’wen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mange ke wi suru pa Israel gi eni: mi Jurubeni en e Eliezer ma wod Zikri ma jabim: mi Jusimeoni, Cefatia ma wod Maka: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi Lawi, Hacabia ma wod Kemuel: mi Harun, Zadok; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi Yuda, Elihu, en e ng’atu acel ma kind utumeg Daudi: mi Isakar, Omri ma wod Mikael: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi Zebulun, Icmaya ma wod Obadia: mi Naftali, Yeremoth ma wod Azriel: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi nyithindho pa Efraim, Hoceya ma wod Azazia: mi ng’et suru pa Manase, Yoel ma wod Pedaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi ng’et suru pa Manase i Gilead, Ido ma wod Zekaria: mi Benyamin, Yaasiel ma wod Abner: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi Dan, Azarel ma wod Yeroham. Maeni gi jego mi suru mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.15.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 15:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.22.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.26.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Daudi gamu wel mi joni ngo ma rundi migi pier ario ku ma fodi de, kum Yehova wacu nia ebimedo Israel calu cero m’i polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.24.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 24:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.21.1+1CH.21.2+1CH.21.3+1CH.21.4+1CH.21.5+1CH.21.6+1CH.21.7+1CH.21.8+1CH.21.9+1CH.21.10+1CH.21.11+1CH.21.12+1CH.21.13+1CH.21.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kei 21:1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoab ma wod Zeruia maku kwanu, ento edaru ngo; man kwinyo wok wi Israel kum maeni; kadi welgi de juketho ngo i wel mi lemkei pa Daudi m’ubimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wi piny m’akana p’ubimo en e Azmaveth ma wod Adiel: man wi piny m’akana i podho, i adhura, man i pacu, man i udi ma tek, en e Yonathan ma wod Uzia: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wi ju m’utimo tic mi podho m’ufuro ng’om en e Ezri ma wod Kelub: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wi podho mir ulok en e Cimei ma Jaramathi: man wi medri mi podho mir ulok mi otkan pigulok en e Zabdi ma Jacifmi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wi yendulam kud uyelo ma gini i poga en e Bal-hanan ma Jagederi: man wi otkan mi mo en e Yoac: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wi udul lim m’ucamu i Caron en e Citrai ma Jacaroni: man wi udul lim ma gini i poga en e Cafat ma wod Adlai: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wi ngamia en e Obil ma Jaicmaeli: man wi kana en e Yedeya ma Jameronothi: man wi udul rombe en e Yaziz ma Jahagri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
